    },
    "description": "<p>When an adversary targets you or an ally within Very Close range with an attack, you can <strong>spend a Favor</strong> to <em>Drain</em> them. When you do, they must mark a Stress, and you can clear a Stress. While <em>Drained</em>, the target uses a <strong>d12</strong> instead of a d20 for attack rolls (including for advantage or disadvantage) until they fail a roll.</p>",
